      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "This equals \\(\\lim _{d \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac{\\pi\\left(\\frac{d+\\sqrt{d}}{2}\\right)^{2}}{d^{2}}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\).",
